<title>USA: Immucor sets stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Immucor sets stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Immucor Inc said Monday it had authorized the repurchase of up to 10 percent of its common stock in the open market.</p>
<p>The company currently has 8.1 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe market conditions have provided us with an opportunity to enhance shareholder value by purchasing stock at attractive prices,&quot; said Edward Gallup, president of Immucor.</p>
<p>Gallup said the company is not committed to purchase any minimum number of shares and may terminate the repurchase program at any time.</p>
</text>
